ilter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Filtration-Principle-in-Woven-Fabric-p2-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Filtration-Principle-in-Woven-Fabric-p2-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">Filtration Principle in Woven and Non-woven Fabric<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">In a woven fabric, the particle gets collected by one or more of the mechanisms (like interception, internal impaction etc.) resulting in a buildup of dust cake\u2019 which is mostly on the surface.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1785967 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1785967\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-97fd17f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"97fd17f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Shapes of Dust Collector Filter Bags<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-565c0f0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"565c0f0\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-52c8f55 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"52c8f55\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Round-dust-filter-bag-p4.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-